        <item>
    <title>Fleet 1.6.5</title>
    <description><![CDATA[<style>
:root { color-scheme: light dark; }
body { font: 13px -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; line-height: 1.45; margin: 12px 16px; }
h2 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0 4px; }
h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
li { margin: 3px 0; }
p { margin: 6px 0; }
code { font: 12px ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; }
</style>
<h2>New</h2><ul><li><b>Find (⌘F).</b> Search an agent's terminal.<ul><li>In a Claude agent it searches the whole conversation, with Claude's own search, and shows where you are ("2 of 4").</li><li>In other tabs: Match Case, Whole Word and Regular Expression, as in VS Code.</li><li>↑ and ↓ go to the match above or below. ⌘F, Esc or ✕ closes it.</li></ul></li><li><b>Terminal font.</b> Pick the terminal's font and size in Settings ▸ General. Only fonts that display correctly are listed.</li><li><b>One agent, several folders.</b> In New Agent, choose "One agent": it starts in one folder and can also work in the others you pick.</li></ul><h2>Improved</h2><ul><li>The update window shows what's new, like this, instead of a web page.</li></ul><h2>Fixed</h2><ul><li>Text you select with the mouse in a shell stays highlighted after you let go, and is copied.</li></ul>]]></description>
    <sparkle:version>20261109.220133</sparkle:version>
    <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
